  "worked_solution": "We apply the distributive law\n\n$$\nXZ+YZ=(X+Y)Z.\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T & =XZ+YZ \\\\  & =(X+Y)Z \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
